From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: draven <dravengarden@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:35:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Declare native Codex 0.169.1

Widen the @openai/codex dependency from ^0.166.0 to ^0.169.1 so the
adapter declares the native Codex Cowboy packages. 0.169.1 is the first
release whose bundled model catalog carries gpt-6.2-sol and
gpt-6.2-astra. The app-server schema of 0.169 only adds to the 0.166
schema the adapter's generated types come from: new methods,
notifications, optional request fields, response fields and enum
variants; nothing is removed or renamed.

Cowboy-Delta: native-codex-version
Upstream: not-proposed
Drop-When: an upstream codex-acp release declares @openai/codex 0.169.1 or later
Tests: src/__tests__/CowboyNativeCodexVersion.test.ts

